Use alloc, core, io, list.

A record Point has an x (a whole number) and a y (a whole number).
Let points be List of Point.
Let p be Point.
Set p's x to 27.
Set p's y to 28.
Push p to address of points.
Let q be pop from address of points.
Say q's x.
Say q's y.
Free list address of points.
Give back 0.
